## Design System Integration

`useColor` resolves the displayed value color through V2 tokens. V1 → V2 mapping:

| Slot | V1 token | V2 token |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `isColored` positive (and zero) | `statusPositive` | `verdictPositive600` |
| `isColored` negative | `statusNegative` | `verdictNegative600` |
| Neutral (default, no `color` / no `isColored`) | `textPrimaryNeutral` | `carbon900` |

A consumer-supplied `color` prop continues to win over both branches.
